{"parse": {"title": "Arnoldas Kulboka", "pageid": 11355240, "redirects": [], "text": {"*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<table class=\"infobox&#95;v2 infobox infobox--frwiki noarchive\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" class=\"entete basket-ball\" style=\"background-color:#DD8F56;color:#000000;\">Arnoldas Kulboka<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r226939240\">.mw-parser-output .entete.basket-ball{background-image:url(\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/Picto_Infobox_Basketball.png\")}</style>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:KULBOKA.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"Image illustrative de l\u2019article Arnoldas Kulboka\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/60/KULBOKA.jpg/330px-KULBOKA.jpg?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"280\" height=\"336\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/60/KULBOKA.jpg?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x\" data-file-width=\"375\" data-file-height=\"450\" /></a></span> <br />Arnoldas Kulboka en 2019.\n   </td></tr>\n   <tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"padding:4px; text-align:center; background-color:#DD8F56; color:#000000\">Fiche d\u2019identit\u00e9</th></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th scope=\"row\">Nationalit\u00e9\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><span class=\"datasortkey\" data-sort-value=\"Lituanie\"><span class=\"flagicon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-image-border noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Flag_of_Lithuania.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Drapeau de la Lituanie\"><img alt=\"Drapeau de la Lituanie\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/11/Flag_of_Lithuania.svg/20px-Flag_of_Lithuania.svg.pn